        "連日続いた雨の影響で、崖崩れが起きたと聞いた僕は、\n獣神ベヒモス娘のデインさんと一緒に現場に向かった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6601c9ca203fa7982ae57697fed82fbf9b0d3c803a192709417615816d623fa0",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "おおー！　見つけたよ、ご主人！　ここだよ！\nここが崖崩れのあった場所だ！",
      "jp_sha256": "8dac08d7213b699b100833ad4189bb8508a269489ea625211eef5749cd5067b5",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "오오―! 찾았다, 주인! 여기야!\n여기가 산사태가 난 곳이야!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
